he Sacred Valley, 2,792 m up.","It was the royal estate of Emperor Pachacuti.","In 1537 Manco Inca defeated a Spanish expedition nearby."]},{"t0":23.5,"dur":63.17,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":86.67,"dur":19.5,"zh":["皮斯卡庫丘，鐵路旁的「82 公里」，是印加古道的起點之一。","古道全長約 42 公里，健行者通常走四到五天，終點是太陽門。","古道每天只發 500 張許可證，包含挑夫與嚮導。"],"en":["Piskakuchu, \"Km 82\" beside the railway, is one of the trailheads of the Inca Trail.","The trail is about 42 km long; trekkers usually take four or five days to reach the Sun Gate.","Only 500 permits a day are issued, porters and guides included."],"poi":"km82"},{"t0":106.17,"dur":75.21,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":181.38,"dur":19.5,"zh":["列車進入馬丘比丘歷史保護區，1981 年設立。","安地斯東坡的雲霧林，從 4,000 公尺以上降到約 1,700 公尺。","保護區內記錄到 423 種蘭花、444 種鳥類。"],"en":["The train enters the Historic Sanctuary of Machu Picchu, established in 1981.","Cloud forest on the eastern Andes, from above 4,000 m down to about 1,700 m.","The sanctuary has recorded 423 kinds of orchid and 444 kinds of bird."],"poi":"sanctuary"},{"t0":200.88,"dur":55.63,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":256.51,"dur":19.5,"zh":["前方山脊上，就是海拔約 2,430 公尺的馬丘比丘。","烏魯班巴河從三面繞過這座山。","1983 年，它列入世界文化與自然雙重遺產。"],"en":["On the ridge ahead stands Machu Picchu, about 2,430 m up.","The Urubamba River wraps around it on three sides.","In 1983 it became a cultural and natural World Heritage Site."],"poi":"citadel"},{"t0":276.01,"dur":1.49,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":277.5,"dur":13.0,"zh":["抵達熱水鎮，海拔約 2,040 公尺，只能坐火車或步行抵達。","1931 年鐵路通車後，鐵路工人營地發展成今天的小鎮。"],"en":["Arriving at Aguas Calientes, about 2,040 m, reached only by train or on foot.","After the railway opened in 1931, a railway workers' camp grew into today's town."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"發車：奧揚泰坦博車站","en":"Departure: Ollantaytambo station"},{"t":95.44,"tt":1972,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 83 公尺：82 公里","en":"Km 82, 83 m right","k":"km82"},{"t":190.16,"tt":3878,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 912 公尺：歷史保護區","en":"Historic Sanctuary, 912 m right","k":"sanctuary"},{"t":265.29,"tt":5347,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 2 公里：馬丘比丘遺址","en":"Machu Picchu, 2 km left","k":"citadel"},{"t":300.0,"tt":5700,"kind":"arr","zh":"抵達：馬丘比丘車站（熱水鎮）","en":"Arrival: Machu Picchu station (Aguas Calientes)"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：路線取自 OpenStreetMap，速度與時間為示意，並非實際班次紀錄；地形與衛星影像為真實資料。","en":"Simulation: the path comes from OpenStreetMap; speeds and times are illustrative, not a real timetable. Terrain and satellite imagery are real data."},"geo_src":"OSM relations 1179376/5646859 (railway ways), shortest path Ollantaytambo→Machu Picchu station","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Ollantaytambo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ollantaytambo"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Inca Trail to Machu Picchu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inca_trail"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Aguas Calientes, Peru","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aguas_Calientes,_Peru"},{"title":"Wikiwand: Historic Sanctuary of Machu Picchu","url":"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Historic_Sanctuary_of_Machu_Picchu"},{"title":"Wikiwand: Machu Picchu","url":"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Machu_Picchu"}]}